[I] An Open Source graphic library

[T] FreeImage is an Open Source library with support for popular graphics
[T] image formats like PNG, BMP, JPEG, TIFF and others as needed by today's
[T] multimedia applications. FreeImage is easy to use, fast, multithreading
[T] safe and portable to most platforms.

[U] https://github.com/danoli3/FreeImage

